<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>
<span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Efficiency Results.</span>
“Data Efficient” shows that this method does not require data beyond the original training set.
“N/A” indicates that the method does not involve online RL training.</figcaption>
