<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix is organized as follows.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="Ax1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Related Work ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we provide an overview of related work and position our contributions in the context of prior studies.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Dataset Details ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we show the details of the used datasets, including ScienceWorld, ALFWorld, and WebShop.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Implementation and Evaluation Details ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>, we describe the details of implementation and evaluation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Variant Methods Testing ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>, we conduct fine-grained variant method testing to validate the effectiveness of our proposed designs.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Parameter Study ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a>, we perform a parameter study to analyze the robustness of our method with respect to key hyperparameters.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Section <a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Case Study ‣ A Goal Without a Plan Is Just a Wish: Efficient and Effective Global Planner Training for Long-Horizon Agent Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a>, we provide a case study from ALFWorld to illustrate the advantages of our approach compared with baselines.</p>
