<br class="ltx_break"></span></span><span id="A7.pic2.2.2.1.2.18.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">Thought:<span id="A7.pic2.2.2.1.2.18.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The hot mug (used as a cup) has been successfully placed in the cabinet, which completes the task goal.<span id="A7.pic2.2.2.1.2.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
