<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span></span>Thought:<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The mug is now hot. The next step is to put it in a cabinet. I’ll choose cabinet 1 as it’s likely accessible.<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
