<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span></span>Thought:<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The cabinet is closed, so I need to open it before placing the mug inside.<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
