<br class="ltx_break"></span></span><span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">Action:<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Put mug 1 in cabinet 1.<span id="A7.F5.pic1.2.1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
