<span id="A7.F15.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Prompt Used for Plan Quality Analysis</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:25.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="361.76" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 358.31)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please act as a professional instruction evaluator and assess the following two sets of global plans.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task description: <span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{task}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GPT-4.1 Plan:
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{GPT-4.1-generated plan}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">EAGLET Plan:
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0040;">{EAGLET-generated plan}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please compare these two sets of global plans across the following three dimensions:
<br class="ltx_break">1. Correctness - Does the global plan accurately fulfill the task requirements?
<br class="ltx_break">2. Followability - Is the global plan clear, easy to understand, and are the steps reasonable?
<br class="ltx_break">3. Standardization - Does the global plan follow a consistent and standardized format?
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F15.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For each dimension, please indicate which global plan is better and provide reasoning. 
<br class="ltx_break">Finally, provide an overall assessment.
<br class="ltx_break">Please output the result in JSON format, including the following fields:
<br class="ltx_break">{
<br class="ltx_break">  correctness_better": "GPT-4.1"/"EAGLET"/"tie",
<br class="ltx_break">  "correctness_reason": "reason",
<br class="ltx_break">  "followability_better": "GPT-4.1"/"EAGLET"/"tie",
<br class="ltx_break">  "followability_reason": "reason",
<br class="ltx_break">  "standardization_better": "GPT-4.1"/"EAGLET"/"tie",
<br class="ltx_break">  "standardization_reason": "reason"
<br class="ltx_break">}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>Prompt used for plan quality analysis.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
